#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:5
#: 19ffb2ef70434a04b39eee223e4cb7f6
msgid "Roll, Pitch and Yaw Controller Tuning"
msgstr "横滚、俯仰和偏航控制器调参"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:6
#: d7cfc81317fa4ae0be0fb8f361ab760b
msgid ""
"Except for very heavy, slow, or extremely nimble vehicles, Autotune should "
"produce very acceptable results. Manual tuning should be reserved for "
"vehicles that do not fly well after Autotune has been done."
msgstr ""
"除了非常重型、缓慢或极为灵活的飞行器外，AutoTune 应能产生非常可接受的结果。手动调参应留给 AutoTune 完成后飞行效果仍不佳的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:10
#: 18c9732bcc49447694dac1195c679282
msgid ""
"The default values for the roll and pitch controllers in Plane prior to "
"Autotuning are quite deliberately a bit small for most aircraft. This is "
"because small values may cause ArduPilot to not navigate as well and be "
"sluggish, but are less likely to cause the aircraft to crash."
msgstr ""
"Plane 在 AutoTuning 前的横滚和俯仰控制器默认值故意设置得对大多数飞机偏小。这是因为较小的值可能导致 ArduPilot "
"导航效果不佳且响应迟钝，但不太可能导致飞机坠毁。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:12
#: 9af970ce35e749dc925897fddf1ee787
msgid ""
"There is a new YAW controller which can be used in ACRO mode (previous "
"versions had no YAW rate stabilization in ACRO mode). This controller can be"
" AutoTuned just like roll and pitch during an AutoTuning session using "
"AUTOTUNE mode or RCx_OPTION = 107 on a switch. This is independent of the "
"yaw dampner and side-slip controller used in other angle stablized modes "
"such as CRUISE or AUTO (see :ref:`yaw-controller-tuning`) below."
msgstr ""
"有一个新的偏航控制器，可在 ACRO 模式下使用（以前版本在 ACRO 模式下没有偏航速率稳定）。此控制器可以像横滚和俯仰一样在 AutoTuning "
"会话中自动调参，使用 AUTOTUNE 模式或开关上的 RCx_OPTION = 107。这独立于其他角度稳定模式（如 CRUISE 或 "
"AUTO）中使用的偏航阻尼和侧滑控制器（参见下方 :ref:`yaw-controller-tuning`）。"

