#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:57
#: a8cfd2accbfe46258234def0b30b8c2c
msgid "Tuning Overview"
msgstr "调参概述"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:59
#: 921aac358e54468f9e482cb3aab53978
msgid ""
"ArduPilot maintains attitude stability by detecting the difference between "
"demanded attitude angle in either pitch or roll, turning whatever error is "
"present in that into a demanded axial rate change, and then using a PID-FF "
"(Proportional/Integral/Derivative-FeedForward) control loop to attain and "
"control that rate to ultimately attain the desired attitude."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 通过检测俯仰或横滚中的期望姿态角与实际姿态角的差异来保持姿态稳定，将该误差转化为期望轴向速率变化，然后使用 PID-"
"FF（比例/积分/微分-前馈）控制环来达到并控制该速率，最终获得期望姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:61
#: 4a5f43343c664e88b78a5f51add6199d
msgid ""
"Normally, most the demanded rate is attained using the FF, or feedforward, "
"term. Much like the human pilot deflects the control surface directly from "
"the transmitter in MANUAL mode to obtain the desired roll or pitch rate. "
"Then the other PID terms act on any errors in demanded axis rate to reduce "
"errors from external (turbulence) or internal (noise,miss-trim, CG) sources "
"to obtain the desired attitude."
msgstr ""
"通常，大部分期望速率使用 FF（前馈）项来达到，就像人类飞手在 MANUAL 模式下直接从遥控器偏转控制舵面以获得期望的横滚或俯仰速率一样。然后其他 "
"PID 项作用于期望轴向速率的任何误差，以减少来自外部（湍流）或内部（噪声、配平偏差、重心）源的误差，从而获得期望姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:63
#: db80149a9aa84fe398282d1206a69e90
msgid ""
"The P term acts on any short term error, the I term integrates over time any"
" long term errors, while the D term acts as a speed-up/damping action to get"
" to the desired attitude more quickly, yet eliminate overshoot and ringing "
"as the desired attitude is obtained and maintained."
msgstr ""
"P 项作用于任何短期误差，I 项随时间积分任何长期误差，D 项作为加速/阻尼动作，更快地达到期望姿态，同时消除在获得和维持期望姿态时的过冲和震荡。"

